@startuml Fetch Comments — Inbox Flow
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #4A6FA5
skinparam SequenceBoxBackgroundColor #F8F9FF
skinparam SequenceBoxBorderColor #AABBCC
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #333333
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1
skinparam defaultFontColor #111111

title Fetch Comments — Inbox Flow

actor "Admin" as Admin

box "Frontend (Vue 3)" #E3EAFF
  participant "AllCommentsView" as AllView
  participant "InboxLayout\n(component)" as Layout
  participant "useInboxComments\n(composable)" as UseInbox
  participant "usePages\n(composable)" as UsePages
  participant "useSocket\n(composable)" as UseSocket
  participant "api.service\n(Axios)" as ApiSvc
  participant "authStore\n(Pinia)" as AuthStore
  participant "inboxStore\n(Pinia)" as InboxStore
  participant "CommentList\n(component)" as CommentList
  participant "InboxSidebar\n(component)" as Sidebar
end box

box "Backend (NestJS)" #E8F5E9
  participant "CommentsController" as CommentsCtrl
  participant "JwtStrategy\n(Passport)" as JwtStrat
  participant "CommentsService" as CommentsSvc
  participant "PagesController" as PagesCtrl
  participant "PagesService" as PagesSvc
  participant "GraphApiService\n(Axios → FB)" as GraphApi
end box

box "External" #FFF3E0
  participant "Facebook\nGraph API v21.0" as Facebook
  database "MongoDB Atlas\n(facebook_pages /\ncomment_states)" as DB
end box

== KHỞI TẠO INBOXLAYOUT (onMounted) ==

Admin -> AllView : Truy cập /comments
AllView -> Layout : Render <InboxLayout />

Layout -> UseInbox : useInboxComments()\n→ { fetchComments, isLoading }
Layout -> UseSocket : useSocket()\n→ socket.io connect + register listeners
note right of UseSocket
  Kết nối socket.io đến\ngetSocketBaseUrl() = origin(ENV.API_URL)
  Đăng ký socket.on('comment:new')\nvà socket.on('comment:read')
end note

Layout -> Layout : onMounted()\n→ void fetchComments()

== FETCHING PAGES (song song với fetchComments) ==

note over AllView, Sidebar
  AllCommentsView KHÔNG trực tiếp fetch pages.
  InboxSidebar nhận props { pages, isPagesLoading } từ parent.
  Thực tế hiện tại InboxLayout KHÔNG gọi usePages() — InboxSidebar chưa có pages.
  (Thiếu: cần AllCommentsView hoặc InboxLayout gọi usePages + truyền props)
end note

== FETCH COMMENTS: Frontend → Backend ==

UseInbox -> UseInbox : isLoading.value = true
UseInbox -> ApiSvc : apiService.get<Comment[]>\n('/facebook/comments/inbox',\n{ params: { limit: 20 } })

ApiSvc -> AuthStore : request interceptor\nĐọc token.value
AuthStore --> ApiSvc : Bearer <jwt>

ApiSvc -> CommentsCtrl : GET /api/facebook/comments/inbox?limit=20\nAuthorization: Bearer <jwt>

CommentsCtrl -> JwtStrat : JwtAuthGuard validate
JwtStrat -> DB : findById(payload.sub)\n.select('_id facebookId name email avatar').lean()
DB --> JwtStrat : UserProjection
JwtStrat --> CommentsCtrl : req.user = AuthUser { userId, id, ... }

CommentsCtrl -> CommentsSvc : getInboxComments(user.userId, 20)

== BACKEND: getInboxComments() ==

CommentsSvc -> DB : pageModel.find({ userId })\n.select('pageId pageName pageAccessToken pageAvatar')\n.lean<InboxPageProjection[]>()
DB --> CommentsSvc : pages[] (danh sách fanpage của user)

alt pages.length === 0
  CommentsSvc --> CommentsCtrl : []
  CommentsCtrl --> ApiSvc : 200 []
end

CommentsSvc -> CommentsSvc : Promise.allSettled(\n  pages.map(page => fetchPageCandidates(page))\n)
note right of CommentsSvc
  Mỗi page chạy song song (Promise.allSettled).
  Nếu một page lỗi → warn + bỏ qua, không ảnh hưởng page khác.
end note

loop song song — mỗi Fanpage
  CommentsSvc -> GraphApi : getPagePosts(pageId, pageAccessToken, limit=5)
  GraphApi -> Facebook : GET /v21.0/{pageId}/posts\n?fields=id,message,story,permalink_url,\nfull_picture,created_time,comments.summary(true)\n&limit=5&access_token=<pageToken>
  Facebook --> GraphApi : FbPostsResponse { data: FbPost[] }
  GraphApi --> CommentsSvc : FbPost[] (tối đa 5 bài)

  CommentsSvc -> CommentsSvc : runInBatches(postTasks, batchSize=3)\n→ tối đa 3 post song song một lần

  loop theo batch 3 posts
    CommentsSvc -> GraphApi : getPostComments(postId, pageAccessToken, limit=20)
    GraphApi -> Facebook : GET /v21.0/{postId}/comments\n?fields=id,from{id,name,picture{url}},\nmessage,created_time,attachment{...},\ncomments{...}\n&limit=20&access_token=<pageToken>
    Facebook --> GraphApi : FbCommentsResponse { data: FbComment[] }
    GraphApi --> CommentsSvc : FbComment[] (tối đa 20 comments/post)
  end

  CommentsSvc -> CommentsSvc : Flatten FbComment[] → InboxCommentCandidate[]\nSort by created_time DESC\nSlice(0, perPageLimit)
end

CommentsSvc -> CommentsSvc : pageCandidates.flat()\n→ candidates: InboxCommentCandidate[]

alt candidates.length === 0
  CommentsSvc --> CommentsCtrl : []
  CommentsCtrl --> ApiSvc : 200 []
end

== MERGE VỚI COMMENT_STATE (isRead) ==

CommentsSvc -> DB : commentStateModel\n.find({ commentId: { $in: commentIds } })\n.select('commentId isRead readAt')\n.lean<{ commentId, isRead, readAt }[]>()
DB --> CommentsSvc : existingStates[]
CommentsSvc -> CommentsSvc : Build existingCommentStateMap\nMap<commentId → { isRead, readAt }>

== UPSERT UNSEEN COMMENTS ==

CommentsSvc -> CommentsSvc : unseenCandidates =\ncandidates.filter(\n  c => !existingCommentStateMap.has(c.comment.id)\n)

alt unseenCandidates.length > 0
  CommentsSvc -> DB : commentStateModel.bulkWrite(\n  unseenCandidates.map → updateOne $setOnInsert\n  { pageId, postId, commentId, fromId, fromName,\n    message, createdTime, isRead: false, readAt: null }\n  upsert: true\n)\nOptions: { ordered: false }
  DB --> CommentsSvc : BulkWriteResult
end

== MAP → InboxCommentDto[] ==

CommentsSvc -> CommentsSvc : candidates.map(candidate → InboxCommentDto)\n• commentId = comment.id\n• author: { id, name, avatar }\n• page: { id, name, logo }\n• post: { id, content, permalink, picture }\n• message, attachment, createdTime\n• isRead = existingCommentStateMap.get(id)?.isRead ?? false\n• readAt = existingCommentStateMap.get(id)?.readAt ?? null\n• replies: []

CommentsSvc -> CommentsSvc : result.sort(\n  (a,b) => createdTime DESC\n)

CommentsSvc --> CommentsCtrl : InboxCommentDto[]
CommentsCtrl --> ApiSvc : 200 InboxCommentDto[]

== FRONTEND: Nhận dữ liệu & Render ==

ApiSvc --> UseInbox : InboxCommentDto[] (response.data via interceptor)
UseInbox -> InboxStore : inboxStore.setComments(data)
InboxStore -> InboxStore : comments.value = data\nupdateUnreadCounts():\n• unreadCount = filter(!isRead).length\n• pageUnreadCounts = { [pageId]: count, ... }
UseInbox -> UseInbox : isLoading.value = false (finally)

UseInbox --> Layout : isLoading = false

Layout -> CommentList : :is-loading="isLoading"\n(isLoading false → danh sách render)

CommentList -> InboxStore : Đọc inboxStore.comments
InboxStore --> CommentList : Comment[]
CommentList -> CommentList : filteredComments (computed):\n• Filter by status (all/unread/read)\n• Filter by pageId\n• Filter by searchInput\n• Filter by timeRange (today/7days/30days)\n• Sort by createdTime (newest/oldest)
CommentList --> Admin : Render danh sách CommentListItem

Sidebar -> InboxStore : Đọc pageUnreadCounts, unreadCount
InboxStore --> Sidebar : { [pageId]: number }
Sidebar --> Admin : Hiển thị badge số unread theo từng Fanpage

== ERROR HANDLING ==

alt Bất kỳ lỗi nào trong fetchComments()
  UseInbox -> UseInbox : catch block:\ntoast({ title: 'Lỗi',\n  description: 'Không thể tải danh sách bình luận.',\n  variant: 'destructive' })
  UseInbox -> UseInbox : finally: isLoading.value = false
  CommentList --> Admin : Hiển thị skeleton → rồi empty state
end

alt Lỗi 401 (JWT hết hạn)
  ApiSvc -> ApiSvc : response interceptor catch 401
  ApiSvc -> AuthStore : clearAuth()\ntoken = null, localStorage.removeItem('auth_token')
  ApiSvc -> AllView : router.push({ name: 'Login' })
end

@enduml
